<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/new-head', { title: 'Press Kit — Kidamame' , url: 'https://www.kidamame.com/press-kit/' })
    %>

    <body>
        <%- include('../partials/new-nav', { alwaysScrolled: true, hideNavItems: false, isInnerPage: true }) %>

        <main>
            <!-- LEGAL CONTENT / PRESS KIT -->
            <section class="legal-content">
                <div class="legal-container">
                    <h1>Press Kit</h1>

                    <p>Welcome to the official Kidamame Press Kit. Here you can find all high-resolution logos, screenshots, videos, and brand assets for media, press, content creators, and promotional use.</p>

                    <div class="legal-highlight" style="align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem;">
                        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; align-items: center; max-width: 480px;">
                            <div class="legal-highlight-icon">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-zipper"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="legal-highlight-content">
                                <strong style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Full Press Kit Package</strong>
                                <p>One convenient download with app icons, branding, screenshots, preview videos for phones and tablets, and promotional graphics.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <a href="https://github.com/marcouberti/kidamame-website/releases/download/1.1/Kidamame_PressKit.zip" class="btn-primary" style="white-space: nowrap;">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
                            Download Full Press Kit (ZIP)
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <h2>What's Inside</h2>
                    <p>The single archive contains all official and up-to-date media materials for <strong>Kidamame</strong> and <strong>Kidamame Discovery</strong>:</p>

                    <ul class="legal-glance" role="list">
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-icons"></i>
                            <span>
                                <strong>Icons & Branding</strong>
                                Official app icons and high-resolution logos for both light and dark backgrounds.
                            </span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen"></i>
                            <span>
                                <strong>Screenshots</strong>
                                High-resolution screenshots for phones and tablets showcasing interactive scenes, animals, and "Did You Know?" fact cards.
                            </span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-film"></i>
                            <span>
                                <strong>Videos</strong>
                                High-definition gameplay clips and preview videos formatted for phones and tablets. For easy web embedding, trailers are also available on our <a href="https://youtube.com/@Kidamame" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube" style="color: #ff0000; margin-right: 0.2rem;"></i>YouTube channel</a>.
                            </span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i>
                            <span>
                                <strong>Promotional Artwork</strong>
                                Key visuals, marketing graphics, banners, and character illustrations.
                            </span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Brand Guidelines</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Please do not alter the colors, aspect ratio, or shape of our logos and app icons.</li>
                        <li>Give appropriate breathing room around our logos in all layouts and videos.</li>
                        <li>Please refer to our app as <strong>Kidamame Discovery</strong> and our brand as <strong>Kidamame</strong>.</li>
                        <li>If you need specific formats, localized assets, or custom dimensions, please reach out to us.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Press Contact & Review Copies</h2>
                    <p>If you're writing an article, need a review copy/promo code, want to arrange an interview, or have other press inquiries, please contact us directly at <a href="mailto:info@kidamame.com">info@kidamame.com</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

            <%- include('../partials/new-footer') %>
